<title>SPAIN: TABLE - Spain five, 15-yr bond yields up at auction.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Spain five, 15-yr bond yields up at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Wednesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE Yield Pvs Price Pvs Bid Allocated</p>
<p> 5-year  5.821  5.668   95.10   95.30   203.60   162.60</p>
<p>15-year  6.693  6.687   92.20   91.70   46.63     30.68</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
